      <h2>A More Coordinated Way to Handle Your Property Transfer</h2>
      <p>Property transfers often require dealing with several offices at different stages of the transaction. Instead of navigating each requirement independently, FIS can serve as your central point of coordination for the administrative and documentary process.</p>
      <p>We help keep the transaction organised, follow up with the relevant offices and coordinate the next steps as requirements progress.</p>
