    <div class="faq">
      <details>
        <summary>Can FIS assist with the property transfer process on my behalf?</summary>
        <p>Yes. FIS can assist with the documentary and administrative processing of your property transaction, including coordination with relevant government offices and other parties involved in the process.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can you assist with BIR and Registry of Deeds processing?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Our property transfer service can include coordination and follow-up for relevant BIR transfer requirements, eCAR and ONETT-related documentation where applicable, Registry of Deeds requirements, and related local government processing.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>I am not sure what documents I need. Can FIS help?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Tell us about the property and the type of transaction you are undertaking. Our team can help identify the documentation and processing requirements relevant to your transaction and guide you through the next steps.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I enquire before all of my documents are complete?</summary>
        <p>Yes. You do not need to have every document ready before contacting us. Send us the details you currently have and we can review the transaction with you and identify the next steps.</p>
      </details>
